# Hardened Academic: "leave YOUR graveyard". Bot1 has the Academic and a Ghost Vacuum ({T}: Exile target card from a
# graveyard) on turn 1 and discards a Plains to the Academic (so its graveyard has a card). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Faithless
# Looting (discarding two Islands) and in Bot2's second main phase the Vacuum exiles an Island from BOT2's graveyard: a card
# left a graveyard, but not Bot1's, so the Academic stays 2/1. On turn 3 the untapped Vacuum exiles the Plains from Bot1's
# own graveyard (the positive control): the Academic gets its counter and is 3/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Hardened Academic
Ghost Vacuum
Mountain
Plains
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hardened Academic.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ghost Vacuum.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Island; Island)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Bot2.Graveyard.Island)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Power = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ghost Vacuum.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Plains)
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Exile.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Hardened Academic.Toughness = 2
